1tkr|n|One who watches or guards; specifically (Mil.), a soldier set to guard an army, camp, or other place, from surprise, to observe the approach of danger, and give notice of it; a sentry. ; Watch; guard. ; A marine crab (Podophthalmus vigil) native of the Indian Ocean, remarkable for the great length of its eyestalks; -- called also sentinel crab.	a:kyx,23,2~kyx,23,2	v:1249,19,3~1249,19,3	n:kyx,13,1~kyx,13,1	N:26m9,47,4;bqo,43,2~26m9,47,4;bqo,43,2
